## Data Sources

- **Bybit API**: Real-time spot & futures prices
  - Endpoint: `https://api.bybit.com/v5/market/tickers`
  - Categories: spot, linear (futures)

- **CoinGecko API**: Market cap & trending data
  - Trending: `/api/v3/search/trending`
  - Markets: `/api/v3/coins/markets`

- **Alternative.me**: Fear & Greed Index
  - Endpoint: `https://api.alternative.me/fng/?limit=30`

